  <item>
    <title>对话骑行群主“晚眠”：重要的是，此刻，骑起来～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672f3bec26e396a36f99522</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672f3bec26e396a36f99522</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 15:05:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🖊️Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> &nbsp;招募骑行连线对象，遇到户外达人—“晚眠”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> &nbsp;成都绿道九连拐 ，绿道秋名山？“让我对骑行爱得深沉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> &nbsp;“分享骑行视频，让我拥有了一个户外群”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> &nbsp;不同的骑行群也有不同的群味儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;下雨天骑行，你虾线了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;单身狗们组队骑行爱心环线：“521我们也一起过节！”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpP1GlccAtNnbkd9eFlVpGngXMuy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆爱心环线地图（来自两步路app）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;骑行能够清除精神上的疲惫，赋予我们更多自信与愉悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a> &nbsp;夏日骑行防晒or不防晒，晒得均匀最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> &nbsp;我是坚定的共享党，骑起来最重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️温馨提醒大家：</span></p><span></span><p><span>骑行时带好头盔，有条件的，把护膝护腕的也戴上</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜骑一定要装上车前灯和尾灯！安全第一</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有很想分享的骑行经历，欢迎留言踢我，或者+v: greeneyesforever</span></p><span></span><p><span>真的非常喜欢大家的骑行故事，透过骑行，看到👀生活和态度</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lts6MD2Y5uEMH1E4hcJgkhqJf-Rc.m4a" length="32428416" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>写给5月：想放松的风吹到了大理和阿勒泰，快乐足够多才能容下不快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6658a37194977a26ef14e23c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6658a37194977a26ef14e23c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 16:04:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>✒️Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 下午一两点的洱海骑行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 进入洱海边，内心开始变得宁静</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> &nbsp;从一个城市到另一个城市，彻底的放松之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 洱海很治愈，和大火阿勒泰的感受非常相似</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 焦虑依旧在，是什么让我没有了大起大伏的情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 5月你骑了哪里？6月你即将去往哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>选一个时间，来到一个新的城市，关掉手机，骑着自行车，来一场彻底的全身心放松吧～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>快乐足够多才能容下不快乐♥️</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv5A5cD_1ma8ZcARy06zQBrV7IZe.m4a" length="5309175" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
