    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Surprise!!!播客间终于迎来了第一位听友的连线，分享他的一些骑行故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> &nbsp;卡师傅:穿戴装备的投入大过车本身，功能性是选择第一要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;骑行真的能减肥吗？ 运动量不够，骑行也帮不上忙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;宁波白云港骑行，打榜的感觉很爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;骑行的收获：心理收获远大于生理收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;骑行圈的朋友和日常的朋友圈是否有交集？</span></p><span></span><p><span>想进听友群的朋友可添加微信：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>GreenEyesForever</span></strong></p>]]></description>
