  <item>
    <title>10月10日：骑行的暴雨天，竟然发现自己成长了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653684a9206650fc6b861a7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653684a9206650fc6b861a7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Oct 2023 14:35:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello,盆友们，这是一次骑行的下雨天，也是发现自己有所长大的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;和自行车一起躲雨的时候，一片红叶落在了我的车垫上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;闺蜜拒绝来接我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;打车滴滴回家第一次失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第二次打车成功，善良的好司机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;即使被淋湿了，心情也很平静</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以前的我会因为别人没来接我而哭泣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;平静处理期待的时候，好像自己长大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主动选择走出失恋的阴影，接收来自骑行的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>写在后续：</span></p><span></span><p><span>在类似的生活场景里，我不再失落</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能是因为在这样相同的场景里，被善良的人治愈着</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次的骑行，其实我也画在了自己的漫画里，是先有了漫画，才有了这期的音频，因为好像比起单纯的图片故事，声音好像更能陪在你身边，描述这个过程中更多的细节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrwZi2ct1Dhdwx_JpCWfuxGddr1i.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvgk3MkILD7cardCE541N3MsCZLy.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjnN8od8UllO9VdtjeBqseR0GW7.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixDCEdq1YoOEvDNBMeMM78SmtS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FolBWvMu9APgFTp0quck3IUw1Y3h.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZhREf6bdbsq3dqtprzTfQH6LxC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQcHvS3oaRIweIjXAlgKWRi-3pa.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flx9hJbvFiIfl7HT3QOkLc9QuMVl.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk6dfy7UKc0F24fU6PgoBh1XZOjv.m4a" length="5805643" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>9月27日：骑行在这个城市，我在寻找自己的位置</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6515986750cf691d24da3ff2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6515986750cf691d24da3ff2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 15:14:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 饭桌上的氛围感总感觉不适</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 骑行到附近咖啡馆，发现3个穿得各有特点的青年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> &nbsp;一家三口，有温馨也有生活的不易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> &nbsp;街边的流浪狗在城市的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a> &nbsp;抖音青年们寻找在城市的某个位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 骑行后的大脑有被清空的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 双节快乐！用轻松的方式去寻找自己的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家双节快快乐乐～～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll396kLbBZBHjlPsgAvCG9wm56Bz.m4a" length="6818860" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:06:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>9月骑行日记：如果今天缺开心，就骑车去晒晒太阳吧～～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650b00be9687557971d34fe9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650b00be9687557971d34fe9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Sep 2023 14:25:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我只是大多数时候在骑行，没有想到骑行中，爱上了阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳光照拂着我的脸，也拭去了心中的阴冷～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的这一期，我们聊聊骑行中，阳光带来的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> &nbsp;阳光对于过去的我来说，非常刺眼，会暴露我所有的缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> &nbsp;没有阳光的出租房让当时的我内心反而更安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a> &nbsp;对阳光看法的转变，从骑行开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> &nbsp;阳光真的很治愈，减低对自我的否定，分泌血清素&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> &nbsp;搭配骄阳伴我等电视剧，檀健次等好演员，阳光力加倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 如果明天有太阳，我们一起晒晒吧 ～～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt4VvSjqrjuLAERWGTpnTlHwHzgc.m4a" length="9327588" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:09:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>变身骑行诗人：天空的美，云知道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f08fc7e490c5dee5fdd28d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f08fc7e490c5dee5fdd28d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Aug 2023 13:04:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 流水账记录上周的天空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 韩剧《恋空》（这里口误更正一下），死去的记忆开始袭击我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 为什么大家都爱天空？看看大家的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> 天空，是一种治愈的存在。因为天空更加热爱成都。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 国外创立了世界赏云协会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 赏云协会宣言：永远记住，要活在云端！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 微信读书《云彩搜集者手册》哲思摘录：好看的东西记录已足够</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 抬一抬头，让天空和云朵陪着你</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲爱的朋友们，骑行的时候，别忘了抬头看看此刻的天空～～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj98OBhW4vJj4dZyhkfmRe_G1WyZ.m4a" length="10721433" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMY1szKMtbQgpkt2eytoxZaUmTR.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>对话骑行新手川川：诗与远方和自在当下我都要</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e75f5280c9ec4c5f2f1a0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e75f5280c9ec4c5f2f1a0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 13:46:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请了我的好朋友，一位才入坑骑行的新手： &nbsp;川川，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起聊聊关于骑行的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 雨后九眼桥的风是混着泥土和水的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 放弃常规，一点点探索新的路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 新手安全第一，基础装备配置：头盔，前后灯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 看车识主人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> 沉浸式骑车，注意力无形中在提高</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待大家投稿邮箱 greeneyes1314@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们期待更多的人分享在骑行中发生的有趣的事情和骑车带来的不一样的感受</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsPhx91iUHPMyhmT4_Y93W2UI0aY.m4a" length="27056974" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:55</itunes:duration>
